<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait's Gulf Insurance says net up 36pct.</title>
<headline>Kuwait's Gulf Insurance says net up 36pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(Million dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>					1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net profit			4.213	  3.103</p>
<p> Total income		    4.559	  3.443</p>
<p> Investment income	     3.306	  2.026</p>
<p> Assets			   44.485	 43.663</p>
<p>Full name: Gulf Insurance Company KSC</p>
<p>Note: The company said it would pay a dividend of 25 fils per share compared to 19 fils per share in 1995.</p>
</text>
